 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting 8': No Money, No Parts, No Deal! (posted 'NMNPND'), Tatooine: Watto's Junkyard, Tatooine: Mos Espa, Start Your Engines!, Tatooine: Podrace Arena, Sebulba's Podracer, Boonta Eve Podrace, Watto's Box; these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Watto Arica' dested two cards, Watto and Arica, and 'Gragra Boelo' dested Gragra and Boelo; the section header says 20 characters, which only adds up this way, and the strategy uses Watto and Boelo separately.",
  "Posted 'Resistance( or Mind Tricks)' dested Resistance, the first-named card; the author swaps in Mind Tricks Don't Work On Me (played in the sample game).",
  "Posted 'Jawax5' dested Jawa (Dark Premiere), as in other DeckTech lists; the Coruscant Jawa has the same name.",
  "Posted 'Boba w/ Blaster' dested Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; 'Dengar w/ Carbine' dested Dengar With Blaster Carbine and 'Dengar's Gun' dested Dengar's Blaster Carbine; 'Iggy in Ship' dested IG-88 In IG-2000; 'Zuckuss in Ship' / 'Bossk in Ship' dested Zuckuss In Mist Hunter / Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'Control/Stun' dested Control & Set For Stun; 'Jabba's Through' dested Jabba's Through With You; 'Mara's Saber' dested Mara Jade's Lightsaber; 'Darth Vader w/ Stick' dested Darth Vader With Lightsaber.",
  "Posted 'Onyx 2' is the Death Star II starfighter Onyx 2 (one copy; the Starships/Vehicles header says 7)."
